message: >-
  If you use Anatomed in your work, please cite it using the metadata below.
  Once the accompanying paper is published, please cite that paper (see
  `preferred-citation`) as well.
title: "Anatomed MCP — interactive region-isolated 3D anatomy inline in Claude"
abstract: >-
  A Model Context Protocol (MCP) connector that renders interactive,
  region-isolated, cognitive-load-bounded 3D anatomy inline in a Claude
  conversation, queried in natural language across English, Latin and Croatian.
type: software
authors:
